The lobby_ca.pem file is the Mozilla root certificate store converted to PEM
by the curl project: https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html
Retrieved 2026-10-16. Certificate data date: 2026-09-25.
Mozilla certificate data is distributed under MPL 2.0:
https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
Refresh this file when releasing clients so the embedded trust store stays current.
The client also uses OpenSSL's platform default paths and DAMNATIONX_LOBBY_CA.
